        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Reguitti SDK068PA Contemporary Oval Pocket Door Pull Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAll new contemporary oval sliding pocket door passage set that offers both fashion and high quality function. Packaged as a complete flush pull set that includes two (2) oval flush pulls, an edge pull, and all mounting hardware. Made in Italy by Reguitti.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in 4 high quality finishes and fit both <b>1-3/8\" and 1-3/4\" thick pocket doors</b>. The edge pull is pressure mounted into the doors edge. The oval flush pulls are installed with concealed screw mounting for that clean contemporary appearance.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching: \r\n<a href=\"/products/contemporary-oval-pocket-lock-privacy-reguitti-sdk068pv\"><b>Contemporary Oval Pocket Door Lock</b></a> and \r\n<a href=\"/products/contemporary-oval-double-pocket-door-lock-set-reguitti-sdk068pv-pa\"><b>Contemporary Oval Double Pocket Door Lock Set</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the SDK068PA Contemporary Oval Pocket Door Passage Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Height: 4-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Depth: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Depth:  3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Height: 3-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/contemporary-round-fingertip-edge-pull-ahi-ep1272\">Edge Pull</a> Diameter: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SDK068PA.pdf?v=1691093347\" target=\"new\"><b>SDK068PA Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Note:</b> The flush pulls <b>project 3/16\" off the door's face</b>. If you intend to use on a <b>pocket door</b>, please insure that you have <b>more than 3/16\" clearance</b> between the door's face and the wall pocket.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> two (2) oval flush pulls, edge pull and all mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
